    <dashboard _.fcp.AccessibleZoneTabOrder.true...enable-sort-zone-taborder='true' name='Considerations'>
      <repository-location derived-from='http://ip-172-31-0-74:8454/t/GlobalStandardReporting/workbooks/cpcchunranalysisDev/Considerations?rev=' id='Considerations' path='/t/GlobalStandardReporting/workbooks/cpcchunranalysisDev' revision='' site='GlobalStandardReporting' />
      <style>
        <style-rule element='dash-text'>
          <format attr='vertical-align' id='dash-text_3' value='top' />
        </style-rule>
      </style>
      <size maxheight='800' maxwidth='1000' minheight='800' minwidth='1000' />
      <zones>
        <zone h='100000' id='4' type-v2='layout-basic' w='100000' x='0' y='0'>
          <zone forceUpdate='true' h='83625' id='3' type-v2='text' w='98400' x='800' y='15375'>
            <formatted-text>
              <run fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='14'>Considerations:</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='11'>- Based the analysis on the online vendors, excluding churned vendors because they went offline from the platform. </run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='11'>- Pre churn or Churn t-1: vendors flagged as churn the last month of activity, so we are computing as churn the month before they churned. This is why we are excluding the current month and the previous. Based on the logic of churn doesn&apos;t make sense to report the KPI up to date.</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='11'>- Excluded outliers in most of the charts such us ROAS extremely high, CVR extremely high, CPC/AOV super high, vendors with 0 orders in the AOV charts. </run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='11'>- Excluded entities with wired behavior Woowa (new in CPC, free campaigns at the beginning), Yemek (due to the migration looks that many vendors churned but they just changed the vendor ids) </run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='11'>- Net ROAS = (commissionable base - commission revenue)</run>
              <run fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='11' italic='true'>[Proxi of the money keeps on the vendor]</run>
              <run fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='11'> / Investment</run>
              <run fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='11' italic='true'> [cpc revenue]</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='11'>- AOV Size: Tiers of bucket size based on the county AOV. Tier 1 is the highest and Tier 10 is the lowest.</run>
            </formatted-text>
            <zone-style>
              <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
              <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
              <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
              <format attr='margin' value='4' />
            </zone-style>
          </zone>
          <zone h='10375' id='6' param='horz' type-v2='layout-flow' w='98400' x='800' y='1000'>
            <zone fixed-size='302' h='10375' id='7' is-centered='0' is-fixed='true' is-scaled='1' param='Image/DH-ICON-white.png' type-v2='bitmap' w='31000' x='800' y='1000'>
              <zone-style>
                <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
